.SS Abstract
Provides compatibility macros for pre\-ANSI (K&R) C compilers.
.PP
If the compiler does not support ANSI C syntax, \f[CR]KNR_STYLE\f[R] is
defined and missing language keywords are replaced with empty macro
definitions to allow the codebase to compile under legacy environments.
