.SS unsigned
.IP
.EX
#define unsigned
.EE
.PP
Defined as an empty macro for Microsoft C Compiler version 2.03 and
earlier, where explicit \f[CR]unsigned\f[R] keyword handling may be
incomplete or incompatible.
